 heir prospects of marriage seem doomed by their family's sudden loss of fo
 rtune. After Henry Dashwood dies unexpectedly\, his estate must pass on by
  law to his son. These circumstances leave Mr. Dashwood's wife and daughte
 rs without a home and with barely enough money to live on. As Elinor and M
 arianne struggle to find romantic fulfillment in a society obsessed with f
 inancial and social status\, they must learn to mix sense with sensibility
  in their dealings with both money and men.\n\nStarring: Emma Thompson\, K
 ate Winslet\, Alan Rickman\, Hugh Grant\, Gemma Jones\, Greg Wise\n\nFilm 
